---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <h1>About Signal Lane</h1>
  <p>
    Signal Lane is an ad-supported research digest. We compile papers and technical news into short,
    specialty-focused reports so you can stay current without drowning in arXiv.
  </p>
  <p>
    There are no reader subscriptions or paywalls. Ads fund the curation. This preview site uses sample
    articles across three placeholder verticals while we test the format.
  </p>
  <p>
    Value is curation and angle — not raw paper dumps.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
